   "body": "A test-only fix is on [the fork branch](https://github.com/skygunner/magpie/tree/fix/5271-auth-lock-event-loop-witness), commit [94d8550c8](https://github.com/skygunner/magpie/commit/94d8550c8bddf965729ab21d528d5fb8a9d37104), based on ed0ab567.\n\nThe test now registers an event-loop callback before starting `changeAuth`. That callback checks that the other host's lock still exists and the pending change has not been written, then releases the lock. The test awaits both release and the completed write. This removes tick counting, the 300/600ms sleeps and the elapsed-time bound while retaining concurrent-write and stale-lock checks.\n\nThe focused test passes with race. As a negative control, replacing the production asynchronous sleep with blocking `Atomics.wait` makes it fail on the held-lock assertion; host.js was then restored byte for byte. Plugin vet, the full offline nogui build, formatting and diff checks pass. The full suite and native Windows/macOS execution were not run. AI-assisted implementation and review.",
   "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
